  data: {
    LLM: '1. Turns: Players take turns clockwise.\n2. Draw: A player draws one card from either the stock or the discard pile.\n3. Discard: After drawing, the player MUST discard one card, maintaining a total of 4 in their hand.\n4. Ending: The game ends immediately if a player reaches 41 points. Otherwise, it ends when the stock is empty.',
    Player: '1. Turns: Players take turns clockwise.\n2. Draw: A player draws one card from either the stock or the discard pile.\n3. Discard: After drawing, the player MUST discard one card, maintaining a total of 4 in their hand.\n4. Ending: The game ends immediately if a player reaches 41 points. Otherwise, it ends when the stock is empty.',
    objective: 'Collect 4 cards of the same suit that sum to 41, or have the highest total suit-score when the deck runs out.',
    gameplay: '1. Turns: Players take turns clockwise.\n2. Draw: A player draws one card from either the stock or the discard pile.\n3. Discard: After drawing, the player MUST discard one card, maintaining a total of 4 in their hand.\n4. Ending: The game ends immediately if a player reaches 41 points. Otherwise, it ends when the stock is empty.',
    keyRules: [
      'The 41 Rule: A perfect hand consists of an Ace (11) and three 10-value cards (K, Q, J, 10).',
      'Discard Awareness: You cannot draw a card and then immediately discard that same card.',
      'Winning condition: Collect 4 cards of the same suit that sum to 41, or have the highest total suit-score when the deck runs out.',
